{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02458","headline":"奉和正日临朝应诏 · 魏徵","name":"奉和正日临朝应诏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"百灵侍轩后，万国会涂山。\n岂如今睿哲，迈古独光前。\n声教溢四海，朝宗引百川。\n锵洋鸣玉佩，灼烁耀金蝉。\n淑景辉雕辇，高旌扬翠烟。\n庭实超王会，广乐盛钧天。\n既欣东日户，复咏南风篇。\n愿奉光华庆，从斯亿万年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"魏徵","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02458.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02458","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}